  "description": "<p>Stay cool and dry on the job with Rothco's Thin Blue Line Moisture Wicking Polo. Made from 100% polyester fabric, this polo shirt is designed to wick away moisture, keeping you comfortable throughout your day. The Thin Blue Line flag embroidery on the left chest symbolizes respect and support for law enforcement. This polo features a classic 3-button collar for a professional look. Additionally, proceeds from this purchase benefit families of fallen first responders, making it a meaningful way to show your appreciation. The shirt's lightweight and breathable material ensures you stay cool and dry, whether on duty or during casual wear.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
